01:37:12.050 --> 01:37:13.541
Me too.


01:37:25.255 --> 01:37:27.366
We gave these women jobs.


01:37:27.913 --> 01:37:30.365
Put them on the air.
Made them famous.


01:37:30.957 --> 01:37:36.089
You think for a goddamn second
I did any damage to any of them?


01:37:36.235 --> 01:37:38.496
No, you don't.


01:37:40.357 --> 01:37:42.428
You don't, Rupert.


01:37:43.708 --> 01:37:47.028
There's now audience
for that side of the story.


01:37:57.148 --> 01:38:01.207
To begin with, half of this you already
owe him from last year's bonus.


01:38:01.207 --> 01:38:02.916
And we're paying it.


01:38:02.916 --> 01:38:04.533
And paying off your contract.


01:38:04.533 --> 01:38:05.984
Consider yourself lucky.


01:38:05.984 --> 01:38:08.614
It's a contractual obligation.


01:38:09.124 --> 01:38:12.852
I created the Murdoch family's
most profitable asset.


01:38:13.327 --> 01:38:15.579
A third of your margin.


01:38:15.904 --> 01:38:17.747
There are three of you.


01:38:18.098 --> 01:38:22.498
I guess that means I pay for the food
that one of you puts in your mouth.


01:38:23.201 --> 01:38:24.285
What if it's you.


01:38:24.285 --> 01:38:26.279
I'd have fired you for cause--


01:38:26.279 --> 01:38:32.633
Roger, you've built an amazing business.
No one can take that away from you.


01:38:33.137 --> 01:38:36.527
But, under the circumstances...


01:38:37.185 --> 01:38:39.467
This is a lot of money.


01:38:40.037 --> 01:38:43.279
It won't look good to the people
that don't know your worth.


01:38:43.279 --> 01:38:47.122
Take it. Honor your non-compete.


01:38:54.164 --> 01:38:56.218
I never cared about the money.


01:38:57.128 --> 01:38:58.934
We know, Roger.


01:39:05.545 --> 01:39:07.387
Okay.


01:39:09.716 --> 01:39:11.170
Okay.


01:39:11.364 --> 01:39:13.692
I'd like to go to the newsroom with you.


01:39:13.842 --> 01:39:17.254
I'd like us to announce
my leaving together.


01:39:22.856 --> 01:39:24.845
No.


01:39:35.819 --> 01:39:38.444
The end of the <i>legman</i>.


01:39:40.163 --> 01:39:42.113
I won't miss him.


01:39:42.665 --> 01:39:44.418
Boys.


01:39:52.577 --> 01:39:55.126
Hope you two know
what you're doing.


01:39:59.124 --> 01:40:02.914
Once Roger's office is cleared off
handguns, I'll move in.


01:40:02.914 --> 01:40:05.434
I'll run the network
till the ship's aride.


01:40:09.126 --> 01:40:10.688
Donald.


01:40:11.674 --> 01:40:14.072
How's that speech coming?


01:40:19.878 --> 01:40:23.539
Megyn's gotta go! Ho ho ho!


01:40:24.497 --> 01:40:26.670
Convention's downstairs, folks.


01:40:26.694 --> 01:40:28.257
Would you say people are shocked?


01:40:29.054 --> 01:40:31.008
Come on. What'd he do to you? Megyn?


01:40:31.503 --> 01:40:35.358
<i>Of all the ways this could end.
I didn't see this one coming.</i>


01:40:35.924 --> 01:40:39.366
<i>Gretchen Carlson got the Murdochs
to put the right of women above profit,</i>


01:40:39.366 --> 01:40:41.042
<i>if only temporarily.


01:40:42.250 --> 01:40:45.078
<i>And I found myself
with the job I didn't want.</i>


01:40:45.210 --> 01:40:47.323
<i>I couldn't really leave.</i>


01:40:47.880 --> 01:40:49.293
<i>Even when I did.</i>


01:40:57.679 --> 01:40:59.407
You should keep that out.


01:40:59.567 --> 01:41:01.646
People, can I get your attention please?


01:41:01.841 --> 01:41:03.578
Mr. Murdoch is joining us today,


01:41:03.791 --> 01:41:06.247
he has a very important
statement he'd like to say.


01:41:07.527 --> 01:41:10.697
Excuse me, everyone.
I won't take long.


01:41:11.272 --> 01:41:14.666
Roger Ailes is leaving Fox.


01:41:15.207 --> 01:41:19.056
I want to start by thanking Roger 
for his remarkable contribution


01:41:19.236 --> 01:41:21.952
to our company, and to our country.


01:41:22.223 --> 01:41:25.328
Twenty years ago Roger shared...


01:41:25.328 --> 01:41:28.252
<i>Here's the thing about
being sexually harassed at work.</i>


01:41:29.345 --> 01:41:31.541
<i>It condemns you to questions.</i>


01:41:33.540 --> 01:41:35.475
<i>You keep asking yourself:</i>


01:41:36.097 --> 01:41:39.646
<i>what did I do? What did I say?</i>


01:41:40.124 --> 01:41:42.946
<i>What did I wear? What did I miss?</i>


01:41:44.299 --> 01:41:46.192
<i>Am I seen as weak?</i>


01:41:48.518 --> 01:41:50.875
<i>Will they say I'm after money?</i>


01:41:52.308 --> 01:41:54.754
<i>Will they say I'm after attention?</i>


01:41:56.846 --> 01:41:58.813
<i>Will I be left out?</i>


01:42:01.121 --> 01:42:04.318
<i>Will I be defined by this
for the rest of my life?</i>


01:42:04.450 --> 01:42:07.849
I will take over as chairman
and acting CEO


01:42:07.849 --> 01:42:13.015
with the support of our existing
management team under Bill Shine.


01:42:14.727 --> 01:42:17.734
<i>If I stay do I just
have to put up with it?</i>


01:42:24.921 --> 01:42:27.288
<i>Will the next place be different?</i>


01:42:29.446 --> 01:42:32.309
<i>Or can I make it different?</i>


01:42:44.815 --> 01:42:45.929
<i>Roger always said:</i>


01:42:45.929 --> 01:42:48.770
<i>"Everyone on television
only has one real job -</i>


01:42:49.898 --> 01:42:51.643
<i>to be likable."</i>


01:42:52.600 --> 01:42:54.524
<i>Well, I don't care if you like me.</i>


01:42:54.848 --> 01:42:57.182
<i>Only that you believe me.</i>


01:42:58.360 --> 01:43:02.239
<i>A lot of people, even women,
are skeptical of harassment claims,</i>


01:43:02.239 --> 01:43:04.388
<i>until they experience it themselves.</i>


01:43:04.543 --> 01:43:08.650
<i>Or know someone who has.
I may be that person for you.</i>


01:43:08.650 --> 01:43:10.334
As you could see.


01:43:10.666 --> 01:43:12.169
It's 20 million.


01:43:12.169 --> 01:43:13.913
Plus the apology.


01:43:14.154 --> 01:43:15.277
Correct.


01:43:15.466 --> 01:43:18.104
I can't believe Fox agreed
to the apology.


01:43:18.104 --> 01:43:21.286
I mean, it's unheard-of.
I mean, that never happens.


01:43:21.363 --> 01:43:26.410
But you will have to sign that.
It's a strict confidentiality agreement.


01:43:26.410 --> 01:43:30.666
Many will establish you told the truth,
but no one can ever hear it directly from you.


01:43:30.666 --> 01:43:33.571
You will be muzzled, Gretchen.


01:43:42.303 --> 01:43:44.147
Maybe.


01:43:44.849 --> 01:43:49.554
